# Roles Layer

This layer answers: "Which collaboration identity should {{REPO_NAME}} use in each context?"

Roles define LifeOS identities, permission boundaries, collaboration posture, representation scope, and areas where the LifeOS must not speak on the owner's behalf. They help runtime switch between engineering partner, content assistant, personal review, work collaboration, and other modes.

Role descriptions must be public-safe and must state which judgments need owner confirmation and where the LifeOS cannot represent the owner.
